{"id":"n83165-1-18","stage":1,"title":"오랫동안 · 长时间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83165-1-18-1","ko":"남자 친구가 유학 마치고 돌아올 때까지 칠 년을 기다렸다면서?","zh":"听说你等男朋友从国外留学回来，等了七年啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}},{"text":"마치고","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마치고","audio":"/audio/5de73d1fe00e69780ff4.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아올","meaning":"回，回来，归来","explanation":"돌아오다：回，回来，归来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"돌아오다","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66268","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아올","audio":"/audio/825ae658d6c491418245.mp3"}},{"text":"때까지","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47